  (text_box "The four inputs are the centre taps of the uplink transformer. BR1 rectifies mode A (pairs 1-2 and 3-6), BR2 mode B (pairs 4-5 and 7-8), in either polarity. R1 and C1 are the detection signature. D1 clamps surges." (at 76.2 91.44 0) (size 53.34 12.7) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 120 120 120 1)) (fill (type color) (color 255 255 225 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 50438bc3-1a12-5de4-9eed-0ba28a19ba99))
  (rectangle (start 139.7 22.86) (end 271.78 127) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 110 110 110 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 60f73a6a-9821-5eb6-a35e-15206ec0a18a))
