  (text_box "T2P is high (3.3 V) when the PSE ran two class events, which is its grant of 25.5 W. C3 holds the result for at least 1.4 s after power-up; the firmware reads it at boot." (at 269.24 147.32 0) (size 55.88 11.43) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 120 120 120 1)) (fill (type color) (color 255 255 225 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9d3304a6-f1ba-5cae-adbe-0d04a15681ca))
